### @env local

POST {{host}}/posts
Authorization: {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="postData"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "test title",
  "content": "test content",
  "postType": "FREE"
}
--boundary123--
